Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Terms: clearly disclosed arbitration and class-action
 waiver (draft)

- Section 9 'Dispute resolution: binding arbitration and class-action
  waiver' is an indented, bordered section with a bold heading and a
  read-carefully notice; a key-term notice at the top of the Terms points
  to it. Includes informal resolution first, jury waiver, class waiver,
  small-claims and urgent-relief exceptions, a 30-day opt-out, and a
  fallback if the waiver is unenforceable.
- Provider and location come from LEGAL_ARBITRATION_PROVIDER and
  LEGAL_ARBITRATION_LOCATION; marked as a draft for legal review.
- Sign-up, employee and Enterprise consent checkboxes now name binding
  arbitration and the class-action waiver and link to Section 9.
- Test added for visibility and consent wording.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
